  "caption_cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.069,
      "end": 6.444,
      "text": "One disputed invoice can begin with a simple question: is this the right company?"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.907,
      "end": 10.078,
      "text": "Veyra turns that question into an evidence case."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.181,
      "end": 15.092,
      "text": "It keeps the request, source, timestamp and confidence together,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.127,
      "end": 19.04,
      "text": "so a reviewer can see what is known, what remains uncertain,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.075,
      "end": 23.023,
      "text": "and why. The live demonstration is a French company lookup."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.092,
      "end": 29.525,
      "text": "A visitor enters SIREN 632012100 and sees a quote before paying:"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.605,
      "end": 35.167,
      "text": "zero point zero zero five USDC on Base."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.689,
      "end": 39.73,
      "text": "The visitor approves the exact amount from their own wallet."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.926,
      "end": 42.238,
      "text": "Veyra never receives the wallet key."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.422,
      "end": 47.567,
      "text": "Sirenic returns the company profile for L’Oréal, with active registry status."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.693,
      "end": 54.88,
      "text": "Veyra verifies the provider’s Ed25519 response signature in the browser,"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.915,
      "end": 58.376,
      "text": "and links the result to the public verification receipt."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.793,
      "end": 61.429,
      "text": "Payment is a separate fact."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.683,
      "end": 69.045,
      "text": "Base confirms the transaction succeeded in block 57,501,654:"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.171,
      "end": 77.265,
      "text": "precisely 0.005 USDC to the quoted recipient."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.681,
      "end": 81.34,
      "text": "The signature proves the response came from the provider."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.467,
      "end": 84.393,
      "text": "The Base receipt proves that payment settled."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.555,
      "end": 89.965,
      "text": "Neither proves bank account ownership, payment instructions, sanctions status,"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.0,
      "end": 93.914,
      "text": "or solvency. A person still makes the decision."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.075,
      "end": 99.858,
      "text": "Other scenarios are clearly marked synthetic; shipment data is test mode."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.159,
      "end": 106.371,
      "text": "Veyra. Evidence for decisions. Human judgement stays in control."
    }
  ]
}